        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #c0392b; padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #2c3e50; margin: 0;\">DeepVision.ai</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #c0392b; margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-weight: bold;\">Onboarding Alert</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>Hi HR Team,</p>\n\n  <p>A new employee entry was added to the onboarding sheet, but it could not be processed due to missing or invalid data.</p>\n\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; font-weight: bold; width: 140px;\">Row Number</td>\n      <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\">{{ $json.rowNumber }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; font-weight: bold;\">Employee Name</td>\n      <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\">{{ $json.employeeName }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; font-weight: bold;\">Issue Details</td>\n      <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\">{{ $json.validationErrors }}</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <p>Please correct the relevant fields directly in the Google Sheet. Note that this row will not be automatically reprocessed — you may need to add it again as a new row once corrected.</p>\n\n  <p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">\n    Best regards,<br>\n    <strong>DeepVision.ai HR Automation</strong>\n  </p>\n\n  <div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 15px; font-size: 12px; color: #888888;\">\n    <p>DeepVision.ai — Powering Tomorrow with Intelligence</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
